  objectName: Recorded dialogue
  description: "Recognized dialogue:\r\n+ I think I left my ID outside the gate\u2026
    I didn\u2019t realize we\u2019ve been talking all day!\r\n- Gotta wait until
    the investigation\u2019s over. We can\u2019t leave here until then\u2026 Who
    is that one that died anyway?\r\n+ Right. We\u2019re supposed to meet her right
    now. She told us it\u2019s a corporate secret nobody else has right now. It\u2019s
    so mysterious she had to send us the encrypted files THEN bring the password
    in person\u2026\r\n-Oh, no\u2026 This might mean something worse is behind her\u2026\r\n+Great,
    I haven\u2019t even heard her voice! What stupid prank is this?!\r\n"
